73:  - `dataTable({ columns, rows, sort?: {key, dir}, sortHref?: (key, dir) => string, empty?: string }): string` from `#kit/table` — sorts `rows` by `sort` (comparing `col.value(row)` or `row[col.key]`, via `localeCompare` for strings; `Array#sort` is stable so ties keep snapshot order); sortable headers link to `sortHref(key, nextDir)` (escaped, so pass a raw `&`); active header gets ` ▲`/` ▼` and `aria-sort`; returns `empty` instead of a table when `rows` is empty. Cells are `<td>${col.render ? col.render(row) : esc(row[col.key])}</td>` with no whitespace between them.
